A_voltage-controlled_amplifier_(VCA)\nis_an_electronic_amplifier_that_varies\nits_gain_depending_on_the_control_voltage.=压控放大器(VCA)是一种\n根据控制电压改变\n增益的电子放大器。
A_voltage-controlled_oscillator_or_VCO_is\nan_electronic_oscillator_whose_oscillation\nfrequency_is_controlled_by_a_voltage_input.=压控振荡器(VCO)是一种\n振荡频率由电压输入\n控制的电子振荡器。
An_amplifier_increases_the_voltage\nof_an_input_signal_by_a_configurable\ngain_and_outputs_that_voltage.=放大器通过可配置的增益\n增加输入信号的电压\n并输出该电压。
Cut-off_frequency_%1$_Hz=截止频率%1$ Hz
Gain=增益
Gain_for_input_§13=输入§13的增益
Gain_for_input_§22=输入§22的增益
Gain_for_input_§41=输入§41的增益
Gains=增益
Lowpass_filter_-_Passes_signals_with_a\nfrequency_lower_than_a_certain_cutoff_frequency\nand_attenuates_signals_with_frequencies_higher\nthan_the_cutoff_frequency.=低通滤波器 - 允许频率低于\n截止频率的信号通过，\n并衰减频率高于截止频率的信号。
Operational_Amplifier_-_DC_coupled\nhigh-gain_voltage_amplifier_with\ndifferential_input._Can_be_used_to\ncompare_voltages_or_as_configurable_amplifier.=运算放大器 - 直流耦合的\n高增益电压放大器，\n具有差分输入。可用于\n比较电压或作为可配置放大器。
Params=参数
Proportional–integral–derivative_controller._A_PID\ncontroller_continuously_calculates_an_error_value_as\nthe_difference_between_a_desired_setpoint_and_a_measured\nprocess_variable_and_applies_a_correction_based_on\nproportional,_integral,_and_derivative_terms.=比例-积分-微分控制器。PID控制器\n持续计算误差值，即期望设定值\n与测量过程变量之间的差值，\n并根据比例、积分和微分项\n应用修正。
Samples_the_voltage_of_a_varying_analog_signal_when\nthe_clock_input_changes_from_0_to_1_and_holds_its\noutput_voltage_at_a_constant_level_until_next_clock_pulse.\nYou_can_see_it_as_an_analog_D-Flipflop.=当时钟输入从0变为1时，\n对变化的模拟信号电压进行采样，\n并保持输出电压恒定直到下一个时钟脉冲。\n可以将其看作模拟D触发器。
The_summing_unit_outputs_the_sum_of\nthe_three_weighted_inputs.The\ngain_for_each_input_can_be_configured.=求和单元输出三个加权输入的和。\n每个输入的增益可以单独配置。

